-- ==============================================================================================
-- DynSnow v1.2 for S.T.A.L.K.E.R. G.A.M.M.A. (dynsnow_gamma.script)
-- Inspired by Garry's Mod dynSnow | 100% Original Clean-Room Implementation | License: MIT
--
-- Features (v1.2):
--   1. Persistent 5+ Minute Multi-Actor 3D Snow Trenches (Player + Stalkers + Mutants)
--      with smooth start-to-end (tail-to-head) snow fill-in & 25-slot 32m GPU window streaming
--   2. Zero fake 2D footprint or melt decals — 100% volumetric DX11 parallax deformation (0 KB VRAM)
--   3. Butter-smooth, continuous dt-interpolated 3D Campfire Snow Melting & Re-Snowing (up to 2 fires)
--   4. Subtle, authentic Crystalline Frost & Fine Snow Dusting on Weapons (matches INVERNO reference)
--   5. 100% Continuous Outdoor Snowfall Hook + Tree Snow Cascades on branch hits/explosions
-- ==============================================================================================

